        "title_style": "h4",
        "subtext": "Blueair follows a carefully designed refurbishment process to ensure only the most qualified units are considered for refurbishment. <br> <br>\nBefore these units are made for sale, they go through an extensive functional, visual, cosmetic assessment, and detailed cleaning process.\n<br> <br>\nOnly then are they given a brand-new Blueair genuine filter (and pre-filter if applicable) and packaged in our originally certified Blueair packaging.",
